  "ingredients": [
    "1 3/4 cups white sugar",
    "1 (18 ounce) jar smooth peanut butter",
    "2 eggs",
    "36 milk chocolate candy kisses (such as Hershey's Kisses®), unwrapped"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C). Place 1/2 cup sugar into a shallow bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tv7EhGoR7TErN2_CsBA_FrzJeGQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/255735-worlds-easiest-peanut-butter-blossoms-steps-01-b1b3ae3bcecd4327b3af1dfbd6773a50.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/255735/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir peanut butter, remaining 1 ¼ cups sugar, and eggs together in a mixing bowl until well combined. Roll into 36 small balls.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LBAfyOf-aGkKT5q4DjElQGDY868=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/255735-worlds-easiest-peanut-butter-blossoms-steps-02-a267b9e514354c1788126180855d961f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/255735/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll balls in reserved sugar until coated, then arrange 1 inch apart on ungreased baking sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/czvvsNgzApP9A43TP4iwE-bxadQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/255735-worlds-easiest-peanut-butter-blossoms-steps-03-c21d9d53a599412cb4b304c58289f177.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/255735/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until very lightly browned on the bottom and the edges are beginning to crack, 12 to 14 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/o9-ZOOTV-GQ9Mqs-VIzXGwB6wfw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/255735-worlds-easiest-peanut-butter-blossoms-steps-04-d42121be0c1c4bb0a19dd879b9c77760.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/255735/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from the oven and immediately press one chocolate kiss into the center of each cookie. Cool on the baking sheets for 1 to 2 minutes, then transfer to a wire rack to cool completely, about 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/952RaTeH46MUPLsX5gtc8ACthnE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/255735-worlds-easiest-peanut-butter-blossoms-steps-05-9a3761fed18d4c02aaf17d09247f9ee3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/255735/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZWstuAxferere3K2mz6F3X1PSvM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/255735-worlds-easiest-peanut-butter-blossoms-4x3-a567ffbf042f473983d016537a22a9fe.jpg"
